&lt;p&gt;From: Frances Werb, To: Ruby Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Postcard Info: Made in Germany. F. B. Stumpf, Importer and Publisher, Eureka, Illinois&lt;br&gt;
Picture Info: Davidson Picnic Grounds, Eureka, Illinois&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dear Friend,&lt;br&gt;
Did you get home all right? I didn’t get home until Sunday afternoon. Write,&lt;br&gt;
Frances Werb&lt;/p&gt;</description>
